5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure we can actually finish the work on time. I'll look into the firms and the site hoarding.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'm more worried about the bills after the party's over. I'll check the upkeep ledger and the groundskeeping roll.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to be here. I would like to see how previous projects have held up over time.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with May's concern regarding the staff. I want to know who is actually available to maintain the park.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's be practical. I'm interested in how people actually use the space and how the land handles the weather.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shizue, what specifically would you like to check?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,I think we should all be very careful about the long-term costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"I shall look into the condition of earlier works and the record of the eastern avenue planting, dear.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I will look into the groundskeeping roll and the volunteer groups.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
